    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Kevin. Please, I am calling about the trash. A neighbor leaves his trash bags at the corner of our street, every week, and the bags are not even in a bin. It is very annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:04:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bags dumped at the corner, not at his house. Got it. Is that something you've seen him do, or just the bags showing up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see him, yes. Monday morning, he walks over and leaves them. Please, I also need to ask how I request a replacement. My own bin was cracked when the truck came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:04:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Replacement bin, sure. I'll write that down. I'll put in a request for a new one and a note about the corner pile. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:04:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. Janice Burdick. My number is four zero one, five five five, zero one nine two. Sorry, I am a little rushed. My family is deciding where to have the holiday dinner, and everybody is calling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Burdick, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-two. Someone will call you back about the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Kevin. Please have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
